  "prefLabel": "Lot 217.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 217.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The hearings officer shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing, or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration within 10 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Lot 200) #12093, eff 1-27-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Lot 200)",
